  "summary": "Make CC-000 registration tests stable across later workstreams.",
  "why": "Registering the first post-CC-000 formal card exposed two fixture assumptions: a hard-coded card count and a selected-state test polluted by unrelated formal cards. The revised tests derive the count and isolate the target, preserving the guardrail for every later registration."
